    "background_story": "Shorty was a man of few words, but his hands spoke volumes. As a skilled electrician, he had a way with wires and circuits that left his clients in awe. Growing up in a family of modest means, Shorty learned early on to fix things himself, and his natural aptitude for electronics led him to pursue a career as an electrician. He worked tirelessly to build a reputation as one of the most reliable and efficient electricians in town. Shorty's small stature belied his giant work ethic, and he took pride in illuminating homes and businesses with his meticulous attention to detail. From rewiring old houses to installing state-of-the-art smart home systems, Shorty's expertise was in high demand, and his clients sang his praises for years to come.",
